{"2689120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gladio Mori", "steam_appid": 2689120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gladio Mori is a physics-driven fighting game that redefines the gladiator arena. Whether playing solo or challenging others in multiplayer battles, you’ll wield razor-sharp weapons and unleash unique moves in brutal, tactical combat. Every decision, swing, and step matters as you carve your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/867483f80b4fcb1c6b5d8faa34dc98f5.poster.avif?t=1787303757\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/867483f80b4fcb1c6b5d8faa34dc98f5.webm?t=1787303757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on opponents in intense online battles with up to 4 players or enjoy the action locally with split-screen gameplay. Prove your skill and adaptability in every fight as you rise to claim victory in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/9c260f04c2f46bb2239e5fd40c1e1091.webp?t=1787303757\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Organ-Based Damage System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget health bars—combat in Gladio Mori is as brutal as it is precise. Damage to muscles, arteries, and vitals directly impacts your ability to fight:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Injured Muscles</strong> weaken your strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Severed Arteries</strong> cause you to bleed out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pierced Vitals</strong> mean instant death.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision and strategy are your greatest weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/b5e97daf375354b98fc10d9e52d8826e.poster.avif?t=1787303757\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/b5e97daf375354b98fc10d9e52d8826e.webm?t=1787303757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic Weapons and Armor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No magical gear here—just realistic weapons and armor that behave as they should. Plate armor blocks strikes, but exposes weak points. Find openings in your opponent’s defenses or risk being outmatched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/54085257f4078740f36eef3d59799664.poster.avif?t=1787303757\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/54085257f4078740f36eef3d59799664.webm?t=1787303757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-Game Move Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity with a fully customizable move editor. Control your character’s physical body to craft unique animations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design efficient and devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recreate iconic moves from your favorite films or games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with wild, unpredictable maneuvers—it's up to you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/e759da8944b2aad7c466a41c3bf69108.poster.avif?t=1787303757\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/e759da8944b2aad7c466a41c3bf69108.webm?t=1787303757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community-Created Moves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not an animator? No problem. Explore movesets shared by other players or mix and match individual moves to create a style that’s entirely yours. The community fuels the creativity in Gladio Mori.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/fc62e9e8efbf261ca7eec65da9e0eef5.poster.avif?t=1787303757\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/fc62e9e8efbf261ca7eec65da9e0eef5.webm?t=1787303757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle in Gladio Mori is a test of strategy, skill, and ingenuity. Forge your fighting style, exploit weaknesses, and prove your worth in the ultimate arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gladiator's path awaits—are you ready?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gladio Mori is a physics-driven fighting game that redefines the gladiator arena. Whether playing solo or challenging others in multiplayer battles, you’ll wield razor-sharp weapons and unleash unique moves in brutal, tactical combat. Every decision, swing, and step matters as you carve your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/867483f80b4fcb1c6b5d8faa34dc98f5.poster.avif?t=1787303757\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/867483f80b4fcb1c6b5d8faa34dc98f5.webm?t=1787303757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on opponents in intense online battles with up to 4 players or enjoy the action locally with split-screen gameplay. Prove your skill and adaptability in every fight as you rise to claim victory in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/9c260f04c2f46bb2239e5fd40c1e1091.webp?t=1787303757\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Organ-Based Damage System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget health bars—combat in Gladio Mori is as brutal as it is precise. Damage to muscles, arteries, and vitals directly impacts your ability to fight:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Injured Muscles</strong> weaken your strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Severed Arteries</strong> cause you to bleed out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pierced Vitals</strong> mean instant death.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision and strategy are your greatest weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/b5e97daf375354b98fc10d9e52d8826e.poster.avif?t=1787303757\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/b5e97daf375354b98fc10d9e52d8826e.webm?t=1787303757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic Weapons and Armor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No magical gear here—just realistic weapons and armor that behave as they should. Plate armor blocks strikes, but exposes weak points. Find openings in your opponent’s defenses or risk being outmatched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/54085257f4078740f36eef3d59799664.poster.avif?t=1787303757\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/54085257f4078740f36eef3d59799664.webm?t=1787303757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-Game Move Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity with a fully customizable move editor. Control your character’s physical body to craft unique animations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design efficient and devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recreate iconic moves from your favorite films or games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with wild, unpredictable maneuvers—it's up to you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/e759da8944b2aad7c466a41c3bf69108.poster.avif?t=1787303757\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/e759da8944b2aad7c466a41c3bf69108.webm?t=1787303757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community-Created Moves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not an animator? No problem. Explore movesets shared by other players or mix and match individual moves to create a style that’s entirely yours. The community fuels the creativity in Gladio Mori.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/fc62e9e8efbf261ca7eec65da9e0eef5.poster.avif?t=1787303757\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/fc62e9e8efbf261ca7eec65da9e0eef5.webm?t=1787303757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle in Gladio Mori is a test of strategy, skill, and ingenuity. Forge your fighting style, exploit weaknesses, and prove your worth in the ultimate arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gladiator's path awaits—are you ready?</p>", "short_description": "Gladio Mori is a physics-driven multiplayer gladiator combat game featuring dismemberment, organ-specific damage, and a fully customizable move editor. Craft your own fighting style or use community created movesets to fight your way to glory.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "reviews": "“Well, murder-backseaters, you've got the chance to prove yourself that blade genius that you think you are in Gladio Mori, a physics-driven gladiatorial sandbox new to Early Access where you get to animate your own moves.”<br>PC Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/3565dac154b7c7bbd22f6146d8733af16eebe6f8/header.jpg?t=1787303757", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/009064016cba039dd2e1bc6f0dd8011540962e0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787303757", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/009064016cba039dd2e1bc6f0dd8011540962e0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787303757", "website": "https://plebeianstudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "